Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single night, the lonely boy desperately wished he could completely stop time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.59,0:00:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then one miraculous day, his deepest wish finally came true across the quiet room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.38,0:00:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He could suddenly freeze everything around him, including falling rain and bustling people everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.64,0:00:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,During these moments of absolute control, he initially felt like an almighty powerful god.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.74,0:00:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He selfishly used his incredible power to easily win fights and completely avoid all pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,However, slowly and painfully, he began to notice a truly terrifying and irreversible cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single time time stopped, someone he loved dearly forgot a precious memory forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.30,0:00:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Completely desperate now, he stopped time one final time and whispered his broken truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He gently let time flow again, choosing a real world where he could stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.50,0:00:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,For the very first time in his life, he proudly chose to grow older.
